    "detailed_description": "You are <strong>Henry</strong>, a young man who finds himself thrust into an unknown world after a frightening accident. Despite waking at <strong>home</strong> shortly after, Henry discovers that the shift between realities would happen again... and again.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923880/extras/3414ac01f42d21facc7d0fd8f2d97d6f.poster.avif?t=1715144804\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923880/extras/3414ac01f42d21facc7d0fd8f2d97d6f.webm?t=1715144804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923880/extras/3414ac01f42d21facc7d0fd8f2d97d6f.mp4?t=1715144804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Henry's <strong>father</strong> explores every possibility to shield his son from this mysterious realm. However, after years of searching for answers, a gripping turn of events reveals to him <strong>powerful meaning</strong> and <strong>hope</strong> inherent to Henry's struggle. He begins to believe that Henry should embrace the ability given to him and delve even deeper into his world to uncover the <strong>truth within</strong>. In an effort to prevent this perspective from reaching Henry, an attempt is made on the father's life that tragically sends him into a <strong>coma</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923880/extras/548b1a88cc1a751a94b0ac3e7921a4ba.poster.avif?t=1715144804\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923880/extras/548b1a88cc1a751a94b0ac3e7921a4ba.webm?t=1715144804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923880/extras/548b1a88cc1a751a94b0ac3e7921a4ba.mp4?t=1715144804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore the secretive world that was made for Henry, long ago.<br></li><li> Craft tools and weapons in your struggle to survive.<br></li><li> Conquer dark and powerful creatures.<br></li><li> Fly over mountain tops with Henry\u2019s Wing-Pack.<br></li><li> Find figments of Henry's dad scattered throughout his world.<br></li><li> Uncover the hidden meaning to the world beyond our realm.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923880/extras/668b1025ea5e347f06d4b9bcb31231cf.poster.avif?t=1715144804\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923880/extras/668b1025ea5e347f06d4b9bcb31231cf.webm?t=1715144804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923880/extras/668b1025ea5e347f06d4b9bcb31231cf.mp4?t=1715144804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
