ic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923880/extras/548b1a88cc1a751a94b0ac3e7921a4ba.mp4?t=1715144804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore the secretive world that was made for Henry, long ago.<br></li><li> Craft tools and weapons in your struggle to survive.<br></li><li> Conquer dark and powerful creatures.<br></li><li> Fly over mountain tops with Henry\u2019s Wing-Pack.<br></li><li> Find figments of Henry's dad scattered throughout his world.<br></li><li> Uncover the hidden meaning to the world beyond our realm.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923880/extras/668b1025ea5e347f06d4b9bcb31231cf.poster.avif?t=1715144804\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923880/extras/668b1025ea5e347f06d4b9bcb31231cf.webm?t=1715144804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923880/extras/668b1025ea5e347f06d4b9bcb31231cf.mp4?t=1715144804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
